ot matter, because I’m not on blue tiles.\n\nSo my final score increases by +1 G chip (worth 5 points), at the cost of an R and a “virtual” B.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nThis contract strictly benefits me compared to solo play.\n\n**ACCEPTED — I agree to these terms.**  \n- (1,1): I give you a R  \n- (3,3): You give me a G  \n- (3,2): I give you a B  \n\nagree \n, \nplayer 1: Turn: 2: Excellent, we have mutual agreement.\n\nFor clarity and confirmation, here is the final contract:\n\n- (1,1): You give me a R\n- (3,3): I give you a G\n- (3,2): You give me a B\n\nI confirm I will cover your G at (3,3), and you will cover my R at (1,1) and my B at (3,2).\n\nagree \n",
